From 854f3cf53fc0938733def6748d8b7adb79ce5990 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Tue, 14 Apr 2026 16:28:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Add ARC DocumentsUI classes for fydroid-rt

Add 23 org.chromium.arc.* classes that bridge Android's DocumentsUI
with Chrome OS's file system via Mojo IPC:

- FileSystemInstance/Host Mojo bridge (FileSystemInstanceImpl,
  FileSystemHostHolder, ArcFileSystemService)
- DocumentsProvider integration (DocumentsProviderHandler,
  DocumentsProviderRoots) for root enumeration and document operations
- Chrome content providers (ChromeContentProvider, ArcVolumeProvider,
  ArcFileProvider) for Chrome OS file access from Android
- File picker activities (ArcSelectFilesActivity,
  ArcSelectFilesEventHandlerActivity) for Chrome-integrated file selection
- Intent launching with display/window awareness (IntentLauncher,
  DisplayIdTranslator, OpenUrlsHandler)
- MediaStore monitoring (MediaStoreDelegate, MediaStoreObserver)
- Display configuration (ArcDisplay, ArcDisplayLayout)
- URI conversion utilities (ArcContentUriUtils)
- Wayland service binder interface (IWaylandService)

Also adds Mojo library dependencies (org.chromium.arc.mojom,
org.chromium.arc.bridge, android.mojo, org.chromium.arc) and switches
to platform_apis for hidden API access.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I73a93a701ba1a4305f6837d15decb5939472ed54
